{"id":"wb-7-256","name":"青州龙兴寺遗址","title":"青州龙兴寺遗址","status":"catalogue","text":"青州龙兴寺遗址位于山东省潍坊市青州市，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为南北朝至明，文物类型为古遗址，本条按第七批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"http://www.ncha.gov.cn/module/download/downfile.jsp?classid=0&filename=1406261621052128423.pdf","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b8ab05759eb2bf4ed65d30d3.jpg","title":"青州龙兴寺遗址国保.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9D%92%E5%B7%9E%E9%BE%99%E5%85%B4%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/%E9%9D%92%E5%B7%9E%E9%BE%99%E5%85%B4%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​青州龙兴寺遗址国家文保单位立碑。","width":320,"height":204,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}